Python and pip dependencies
================================================================================
Each Python package bundled inside the PyInstaller --onedir output retains
its own license. A licenses-bundle.txt file is generated by the build
script and placed alongside the frozen executable for end-user inspection.
It lists every package pinned in requirements-lock.txt with its version, the
licence it declares, and the full text of any licence file the package ships;
packages that ship no licence text are listed under their own heading.
